@startuml UC002_Create_Project_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC002 — Create a project

actor "Portfolio owner" as Owner
boundary "Portfolio page / project studio" as View
participant "public/js/app.js" as App
participant "public/js/api.js" as Client
participant "src/server.js" as Server
participant "src/middleware/requireAuth.js" as Auth
participant "src/routes/project.routes.js" as API
participant "src/services/projectService.js" as Service
participant "src/domain/projectRules.js" as Rules
participant "src/services/fileStorageService.js" as Files
participant "src/db/database.js" as Data
database PostgreSQL as DB

Owner -> View : Add project
View --> Owner : Blank project form
Owner -> View : Enter core fields and media\nOptionally add notes and one build\nSelect Show in the collection
Owner -> View : Save changes
View -> App : Submit form and selected files
App -> App : Validate and prevent duplicate submission
App -> Client : Create project
Client -> Server : POST /api/projects\nBearer token + multipart form
Server -> Auth : Verify active session and derive owner ID
Auth -> API : Continue authenticated request
API -> Service : Create project for authenticated owner
Service -> Rules : Validate fields, optional notes/build, and files
Rules --> Service : Validated project data
Service -> Files : Stage and store validated files durably
Files --> Service : Durable file references
Service -> Data : Create project and associations atomically
Data -> DB : BEGIN; insert project and ordered media
opt Any notes field supplied
  Data -> DB : Insert notes associated with project
end
opt Build supplied
  Data -> DB : Insert build reference and download permission
end
Data -> DB : COMMIT
DB --> Data : Creation committed
Data --> Service : Saved project and associated metadata
Service --> API : Saved project and associated metadata
API --> Client : 201 Created with project
Client --> App : Saved project
App -> App : Replace temporary data and clear unsaved state
App -> View : Show confirmation and open #/studio/:id
Owner -> View : View collection
View --> Owner : Display saved published project

@enduml
